<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ARRAYSCOPE — comparison-sort instrument</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0a0e13; --panel:#10161d; --panel2:#0d131a;
    --line:#1f2a36; --line2:#2c3947;
    --txt:#d9e4ee; --dim:#7c8b9c; --faint:#546374;
